stances.\nCurrently, I do not have access to them, but can select TPU instead.\n\nAny official update on usable accelerators?\n\nThanks!", "content": "<p>Hey Mar\u00eda,</p>\n<p>There seems to be an issue with the RTX 600 Pro instances.\nCurrently, I do not have access to them, but can select TPU instead.</p>\n<p>Any official update on usable accelerators?</p>\n<p>Thanks!</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "S. Brodehl", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/667711-kg.png?t=2026-07-11-21-04-24", "url": "/sbrodehl", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 667711, "progressionOptOut": true}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": true}, "kernelVersion": 0, "competitionRanking": 106, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false, "teamUpInfo": {"teamLeader": {"displayName": "David Hartmann", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/27819645-kg.png?t=2025-07-15-22-51-15", "url": "/dvhrtm", "userName": "dvhrtm", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 27819645, "profileUrl": "/dvhrtm", "performanceTier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "userId": 27819645, "progressionOptOut": false}, "intro": ""}}, {"id": 3456477, "postDate": "2026-05-12T01:01:17.927Z", "rawMarkdown": "", "parent": {}, "author": {"thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/default-thumb.png", "url": "/"}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {}, "canDelete": true, "isUserAuthor": true, "isDeleted": true, "kernelVersion": 0, "feedbackTrackingData": {}, "isThankYou": false}, {"id": 3458253, "postDate": "2026-05-15T13:24:49.470Z", "rawMarkdown": "Thank you very much. Git sum", "content": "<p>Thank you very much. Git sum</p>", "parent": {}, "author": {"displayName": "Peter Findley", "thumbnailUrl": "https://storage.googleapis.com/kaggle-avatars/thumbnails/15427939-kg.png?t=2026-02-18-16-16-06", "url": "/raist321", "tier": "CONTRIBUTOR", "id": 15427939, "progressionOptOut": false}, "authorType": "COMMENT", "votes": {"canUpvote": tru